# s_nop 0 is inserted only into loops in which at least 70% of the instructions
# are VALUs of older class A or B and at least 50% are VALUs of younger class A,
# and only if MachineLoopInfo is available. Unless stated otherwise, a loop
# consists of a V_BFE_U32 followed by 10 VALUs of younger class A and older
# class B and the branch, 12 instructions.

# The same VALUs before the loop get no s_nop 0.
